e is essential for crypto platforms","og_description":"In the crypto industry, compliance is not a choice, it\u2019s mandatory. At the same time, the regulatory landscape is complex and varies across jurisdictions, requiring constant vigilance and adaptation to continue serving as many people as possible.","og_url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/table-stakes-compliance-is-essential-for-crypto-platforms","og_site_name":"Kraken Blog","article_published_time":"2024-12-02T14:07:35+00:00","article_modified_time":"2024-12-03T15:16:43+00:00","og_image":[{"width":1535,"height":700,"url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/Blog_Header_1535x700.png","type":"image\/png"}],"author":"KrakenFX","twitter_card":"summary_large_image","twitter_misc":{"Written by":"KrakenFX","Est. reading time":"4 minutes"},"schema":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Article","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/table-stakes-compliance-is-essential-for-crypto-platforms#article","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/table-stakes-compliance-is-essential-for-crypto-platforms"},"author":{"name":"KrakenFX","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/person\/87e55a5e8ea020a6e620192589a05abf"},"headline":"Table stakes: Compliance is essential for crypto platforms","datePublished":"2024-12-02T14:07:35+00:00","dateModified":"2024-12-03T15:16:43+00:00","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/table-stakes-compliance-is-essential-for-crypto-platforms"},"wordCount":846,"commentCount":0,"publisher":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#organization"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/industry-news\/table-stakes-compliance-is-essential-for-crypto-platforms#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/Blog_Header_1535x700.png?fit=1535%2C700&ssl=1","keywords":["compliance","featured","Kraken"],"articleSection"